{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ikFyA0JXnd1793279134.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一連4日的美酒佳餚巡禮展開。活動開展第一日，現場人山人海，不少市民排隊入場。</p><p></p><p>今年規模比往年大，現場有超過340個攤位，匯聚超過30個地區的佳餚及地道美食。有商戶表示，除了可品嚐美酒外，今年亦有不少本地特色創意美食，例如鮑魚漢堡等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.511589+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:08.178778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:25.861065+00:00","content_hash":"3f36305dd7fe1e1d5326070731a84bcce593bbfaf53cc4bec89ca5123e5614b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.511589+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}